Z||000005||FieroMaster88||07-09-2001||12:54 AM||||Well...the 6 cyl is much fun.  Was a lot of work but well worth it.  It has a few vacuume leaks and such i have to sort through...but the biggest problem is that it just shut down on the highway earlier..and now it wont start.  OOh well...got it towed home and i will figure it out tomorow.<P>It has spark, fuel pressure, cranks over, changed the ignition module and still no start.  Ooh yeah...the lifters all still move too.  But i am too tired to even attempt to figure it out tonight.  I am not about to try ANOTHER 24 hours of workin on it.  Did that twice last week.  I do believe that in the long run it will be worth it..just have to work all the bugs out.<P>Later<P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">         <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe 30,000 miles||||reg||9
Z||000006||The Fieromaster||07-09-2001||01:52 AM||||Yes Yes.  We did take pics  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">...  As soon as i get them developed I will post em!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> James that sucks that the ignition modual wasnt the problem! DAMN DAMN DAMN!  Well hope you guys can figure out the malfunction...  Hope my car is done in time too  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      "Raced That Wrecked Better"<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">     <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>AIM: Fieromaster<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||10
